  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "これで上がった……か？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0272",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──うん\r\nちゃんとアップされてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おー、よかった……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……地方で個人の仕事なんて、\r\nあんまりない機会だからさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "SNSで発信とかもできるといいと思って\r\nやり方、覚えてきたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！\r\nはは、偉いぞ樹里",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、初めての投稿ってわけじゃないよな？\r\nいつもはどうしてたんだ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まぁ、投稿自体そんなしねーけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "どうしてもって時は、\r\nだいたい近くにいる誰かに聞いてたな……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ樹里、ハッシュタグはつけたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え？　たぶん、つけてねー……\r\nさっきの投稿、消した方がいいか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや！\r\n消さなくっても編集できるはずだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこを押すと『編集』っていうのが出てくるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201101104/2011011040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それから\r\nタグを一個づつ打っていこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーと……\r\nまずは『#放課後クライマックスガールズ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011040110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あぁ、シャープのやつか！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
